	(text "Expansion board per spec §2a, §6 (P17). J1001 JST-SH 12 at the case wall: 1 GND 2 3V3 3 5V 4 SDA 5 SCL 6 SCK 7 MOSI 8 CS 9 DC 10 RST 11 INT 12 GND.\n3V3 is the core's gated TLV75733P; 5V is local USB only (after the KTS1693). Pull-ups and bulk capacitance stay on the core.\nU1001 TPD4E05U06 (3V3, 5V, SDA, SCL) and U1002 TPD6E05U06 (SCK..INT), assembler-placed at J1001, IO + GND only (SLVSBO7O).\nVRWM 5.5 V, VBR >= 6.5 V at 1 mA: 5V up to the 5.95 V OVLO trip stays below breakdown. C1001/C1002 100 nF at the connector.\nJ1002 J_EXP (JST GH 15), mirrored for reversal: 1/15 5V, 2/14 GND, 3/13 3V3, 8 GND; 4 SCL-12 SCK, 5 SDA-11 INT, 6 RST-10 MOSI, 7 DC-9 CS.\nReversed, rails and GND meet themselves and no two push-pull drivers face each other. Cable pin 1 to pin 1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
